# Stanza language models
# This file is maintained by the stanza_models data manager.
#
# Columns:
# <value>	<name>	<lang>	<package>	<stanza_version>	<resources_version>	<models_path>
#
# value: unique identifier: language code + package + resources version
# name: display name shown in the tool UI
# lang: ISO 639-1 language code
# package: Stanza model package (default_fast, default, or default_accurate)
# stanza_version: Stanza library version (e.g. 1.12.0)
# resources_version: Stanza model resources version (stanza._version.__resources_version__,
#                    e.g. 1.12.0). Distinct from the library version; may diverge.
# models_path: path to the stanza_resources directory containing the model
